WEBVTT

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.250
Admission process, check.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.000
Uniform, check.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.630
School regulations, check.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.760
Cockpit regulations, check.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:14.800
Don't worry, Aerial.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.050
I did an application for you, too.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.600
<i>Arriving at Front Sector 73,</i>

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:23.120
<i>Asticassia School of Technology, in five minutes.</i>

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.060
<i>The ship will now enter a docking course.</i>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.790
That's the school?

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.340
Mom, I finally made it!

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:02.240
What? No way! You can't!

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.680
This is the bridge.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:05.790
<i>They'll die!</i>

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:06.460
What?

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.930
<i>S-Someone is...</i>

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.860
<i>Someone is outside!</i>

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:11.860
Rescue team, alert.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>A person is in need of rescue.</i>

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:14.840
<i>Prepare for extravehicular activity.</i>

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:15.650
Roger!

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.860
<i>Please confirm victim's status.</i>

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.030
It should be over here.

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:22.160
<i>Are there any signs of collision with debris?</i>

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.260
If you move forward, you gain two.

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>What?</i>

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:27.060
I'll save them!

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.670
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.470
Leave the rescue to us!

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.670
Do they intend to leave the ship?

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.240
Damn it...

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.310
<i>Attention mobile suit pilot!</i>

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:44.520
<i>We're opening the exit hatch.</i>

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.830
<i>Stay put until then!</i>

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:48.520
I-I'm sorry.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.020
<i>If you spot someone
in need of rescue, let us know.</i>

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.980
<i>We'll respond immediately.</i>

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:53.980
Yes sir!

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:31.210
Almost out of oxygen. Beginning rescue!

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:44.810
Are...

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.600
Are you okay?

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.520
Hello? Can you--

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.220
Don't interfere!

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.500
Excuse me?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.630
I'd almost made my escape!

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.800
Because of you, it's all for nothing!

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.180
You'll take responsibility for this.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:02.970
Sure.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.200
Ms. Suletta Mercury?

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.900
Y-Yes!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.320
You're here to observe the drills, right?

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:48.760
I'm Nika Nanaura,
a second-year student in Mechanics.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.700
If you have any questions, just ask.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.790
Yes, M...

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.920
Thank y...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.490
Thank y-you verr...

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.750
Are you nervous?

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.670
I-I've never...

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.420
been to...

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.590
a school before.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:05.410
It's your first time?

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:08.010
Say, is it true you're from Mercury?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.720
Do people live there?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.460
What's your major?

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.060
I'm in the Piloting department...

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:16.530
That makes you one of the elite!

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.560
What did you transfer here for?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.900
My mother...

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.990
told me to go.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.120
Your mother?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.420
So did she also tell you
to wear that old-fashioned hair band?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.700
Cut it out!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.470
Yes, of course!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.270
Seriously?

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.050
Miorine Rembran.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.760
I've heard what happened.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.350
Prepare immediately to join the class.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:53.390
Yes sir.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:55.540
I-I'll take...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.020
I'll take responsibility!

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.650
I-I'll help you with your escape!

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.070
Just tell me what I should do!

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:05.740
It's you!

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.530
You're the girl who got in my way!

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:08.280
Responsibility?

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.030
What's that?

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.120
Idiot!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.390
This isn't the place...

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.390
Responsibility, huh?

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.990
Why not let her take it?

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.790
You want to run away, right?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.040
To Earth.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.270
Class is in session!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.640
No more chatter!

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.210
Earth?

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.020
A red Dilanza.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.020
It must be Guel Jeturk.

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:56.010
<i>Apologies for interrupting your drills.</i>

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.040
<i>This is an official duel,</i>

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.150
<i>approved by the Dueling Committee.</i>

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.900
I, Shaddiq Zenelli, will be the witness.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.650
<i>I ask that no one interfere.</i>

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:09.950
<i>A duel?</i>

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.250
Hey! That way is...

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:23.740
No way.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:24.880
Are they coming toward us?

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.880
Go, Guel!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.550
Get him!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:32.960
Ms. Suletta!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.450
You fool! Do you want to get hit?

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:39.780
Run!

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.660
Did you see that, Miorine?

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:58.350
How Guel Jeturk fights his duels!

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.220
Both you and the company

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.540
will be mine before long.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:06.080
Class is still in session, brother.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.090
Leave here immediately.

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:11.230
The bastard down there laughed at me.

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.140
Calling me a man with a runaway bride.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.510
Bride?

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:16.930
That jerk.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.950
Hold it, Miorine!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.210
The rules say that when you lose,
you apologize like a groveling worm.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.940
I want you to see how he does that.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:47.770
I'm home.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.570
E-Excuse me!

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:51.980
You again?

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:55.400
I-I just wanted to thank you

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.930
for saving me earlier.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.610
M-Ms. Miorine,

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:01.300
About your fiance--

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:03.820
Stop. I never agreed to any of that.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.660
You mean that guy

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:10.130
just decided on his own that you're engaged?

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.300
-It was a duel.
-

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:11.900
What?

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.080
At our school,

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:18.020
the students settle
important matters through duels.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.920
Money, authority, apologies...

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.010
Even marriage partners.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:27.010
So you're going to marry him?

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:27.920
Why?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.170
My lousy father designed it that way.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.920
Jeturk Heavy Machinery,

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.430
Peil Technologies,

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.560
Grassley Defense Systems...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:47.560
These three are the Benerit Group's
highest earners for this period.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.330
However,

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.320
the Parneo Company has recorded a loss

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.420
for three consecutive periods.

00:09:56.340 --> 00:10:00.130
Our group has no need
for companies in the red.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.950
I am hereby suspending their access
to the group's finances.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.850
<i>Wait a minute, President Delling!</i>

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.340
<i>If that happens, we'll go bank--</i>

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.100
Exactly.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:11.960
You'll go bankrupt.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:17.560
Their financial documents indicate
there is potential for recovery.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.200
They've had their chance.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:23.260
The only thing I'm interested in is results.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:32.530
I've assigned two agents
to keep watch on Mistress Miorine.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.620
Would you like to meet them?

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:35.940
For what?

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.610
You know better than to waste my time.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:49.470
Stay out!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.390
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.890
What is your deal?

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:57.140
Excuse me, what is that?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:59.270
What is what?

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:01.340
It's a tomato, naturally.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.100
That's a tomato?

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:06.440
What exactly do you Mercurians eat?

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.200
We do have tomato flavoring, but...

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.270
Here.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.320
Th-Thank you!

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:27.210
Just bite into it.

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:35.150
It's good!

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.870
Not all tomatoes taste good.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:40.130
That one's special.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.840
My mother made it.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.340
She made a tomato?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.240
That specific breed, of course!

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:48.700
Your mother...

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.320
It's the same for me.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.440
My mother

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.250
sent me here to study, so that I could

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.590
make Mercury a more prosperous planet.

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:03.090
That's why...

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:03.910
I see.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.910
So your mother is still alive.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.050
S-S-Sorry!

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:12.010
Hand me your student notebook.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:12.910
Why?

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:17.940
You don't know the way back, right?

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:21.970
Once I've given you the school map app,
scram and leave me alone.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.510
Playing farmer again?

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:26.640
All this pretending you're on Earth...

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.900
what's it good for?

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:29.970
Guel.

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:31.950
You can't just barge in here.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:33.740
I came up with a bright idea.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.790
From now on, you're gonna live
with us at Jeturk House.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:41.440
We can't have any more
escape attempts, after all.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.000
I never agreed to this.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.420
It's your father who made the rules.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.200
Do we always have to follow
what our parents decide?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.780
Aren't you daddy's little lap dog.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:57.140
What are you doing? Leave them alone!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.380
Oh, how clumsy, my lady!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.800
Better watch yourself!

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:07.940
W-We have to... we have to stop--

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:11.350
If you want to stop my brother, do it yourself.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.270
Sh-She needs h...

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.790
I've been too lenient with you, it seems.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.580
As your future husband,

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.780
I'll have to teach you some discipline.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:27.410
You just need to shut your mouth
and give yourself over to me.

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:37.040
D-D-Didn't your mother ever teach you?

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.040
You can't act like that!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.670
What the hell's your problem?

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.770
Don't you know who I am?

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:47.210
Um, well...

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.850
A pushy suitor?

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:52.350
I happen to be

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.240
the heir to one of
the three branches of the Benerit Group,

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.570
the head of the Dueling Committee,

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.350
and the reigning Holder!

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.410
Holder?

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:05.660
The school's number one pilot,
as chosen through duels.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.490
Th-That may be true, but...

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.620
But what's wrong is wrong!

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:13.220
Please tell Ms. Miorine

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.370
that you're sorry!

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:17.970
Here at this school,

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:21.220
right and wrong are decided through duels.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:24.270
Or would you like to duel me yourself?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.480
I accept.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.480
What?

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:32.140
You and I will duel!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:35.810
Stop it! This has nothing to do with you!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.120
Sounds fun.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.410
If you lose, you'll have to leave the school.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:40.110
Right.

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.580
You idiot!

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:43.830
I'll do it.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.570
Send the carrier to Gate No. 2!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.660
Load it with spare packs, too!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.830
<i>The carrier is now moving to Gate No.2.</i>

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:56.330
Spare packages are loaded.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.620
There's gonna be a duel!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.180
With Mr. Guel!

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:00.090
Who's he against?

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:01.310
A transfer student, I hear.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.140
<i>Passage to tactical testing sector.</i>

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:04.390
<i>No obstacles.</i>

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:05.880
<i>Takeoff granted!</i>

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.840
Are you sure about this?

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.900
If Delling dies,

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:17.150
my son Guel's engagement will be secured.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:21.020
I have to act before the results
of these silly "duels" are nullified.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.400
Set the detonation
for ten minutes after launch.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.540
Delling...

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:32.110
our long friendship ends today.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.540
<i>Environmental setting data
for tactical testing sector received.</i>

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.120
<i>Coriolis correction, stable.</i>

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:45.390
<i>Bioinfo, identification complete.</i>

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:48.380
<i>Permet link, satisfactory.</i>

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:52.020
KP001, Guel Jeturk.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:53.390
Dilanza, let's go!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.750
Show-off.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.290
Aren't you going to watch, Elan?

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.530
Who cares.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.650
<i>Why accept a duel from that country bumpkin?</i>

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.750
I'll make it quick for her.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:18.350
I'm the future ace of Dominicus, after all.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:22.410
There she is. The Mercurian girl.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:26.750
Tricolor means a three-colored flag,

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.750
She's got a flashy one, too.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:30.350
especially the national emblem of old France.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:30.350
I don't see a logo. Could it be handmade?

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:33.520
Arriving at the designated coordinates.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:34.480
<i>With mutual consent by both parties,</i>

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:36.680
<i>we will now begin the duel.</i>

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.650
As always, victory will go

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:42.930
to the first one to break the blade antenna
of their opponent's mobile suit.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.230
<i>Both parties, face off!</i>

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.330
What?

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:48.750
Isn't that the princess?

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.410
I thought it was the transfer student?

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:53.700
How did Ms. Miorine board Aerial?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.080
Right.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.320
Ms. Suletta?

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:00.880
What's wrong?

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.710
What's the meaning of this, Miorine?

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.730
I'm sick of people making decisions for me.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.500
This is my fight!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:15.430
Impudent girl. Have it your way.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:19.010
I'll show you firsthand
that you're no match for me.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.080
<i>Guel?</i>

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.860
<i>Do you approve the change in duel opponent?</i>

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.770
I approve.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:29.400
Victory is never decided by
mobile suit performance alone.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:33.030
Nor by the skill of the pilot, alone.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.490
The result itself is the only truth!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.490
The result itself is the only truth!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.260
Fix release!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.630
Weapons. Where are the weapons?

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.570
Did you think any amateur
could handle a mobile suit?

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:57.970
Two minutes left.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.860
It's my life...

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:04.950
let me do as I please!

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.740
I'll decide for myself!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:16.730
The princess of Management Strategy
has no chance of winning.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.570
<i>Take a good look at yourself.</i>

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.270
<i>You're nothing more than a trophy.</i>

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.000
An alert?

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.160
What? An intruder?

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:31.670
<i>Who the hell are you?</i>

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.710
<i>Exceeding speed limit. Please decrease speed.</i>

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.230
Why is it showing your name, Nika?

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.710
I guess I helped.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.270
Why is--

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:49.320
What are you doing?

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:50.600
Give it back!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.190
What?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.980
Aerial is mine!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.920
<i>I told you, this has nothing to do with you!</i>

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.130
<i>Then fight in your own mobile suit!</i>

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:01.800
<i>Don't be so stingy!</i>

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.800
What's going on?

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:02.880
A falling-out?

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.370
<i>It's just another mobile suit!</i>

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:06.010
<i>Aerial isn't just another one!</i>

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:09.100
We were raised together,

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.580
as family!

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:12.850
Family?

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:15.090
Why don't you let me fulfill
my responsibility by winning?

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.480
Aerial and I will never

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.520
lose to the likes of him!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:21.730
"The likes of him"?

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.640
Shaddiq, I'm changing opponents again!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.410
Give him the go ahead, Cecilia.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.770
Sure thing.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.080
<i>Brother!</i>

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.940
I'll correct your ignorance,
you country bumpkin!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.340
Straight ahead!

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:43.300
My mother taught me,

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:45.080
"If you run, you gain one,"

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:48.120
"but if you move forward, you gain two."

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:49.090
What?

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.250
When you run, you gain one by not losing.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.670
But if you move forward...

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.090
You can win?

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.480
Whether you win or not,

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.770
there are two things you gain.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.010
Experience and pride.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:05.080
Not to mention trust!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:21.900
A shield?

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.030
She blocked it.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.280
In that case...

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.170
What just happened?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.840
What kind of mobile suit is that?

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.640
GUND-ARM...

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:48.470
Gundam.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:56.480
Wh-What... What the hell are you?!

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:04.090
It's time.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.000
Mr. Jeturk.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.240
A last-minute intervention?

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:08.760
No.

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:11.870
<i>Your son was defeated in a duel.</i>

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:13.970
What?

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:16.680
Even if you killed President Delling now,

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:19.850
Master Guel won't be Mistress Miorine's fiance.

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.920
Who was the opponent? Grassley?

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.120
Peil?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.010
No.

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.360
It was...

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:36.450
Excuse me...

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.320
I-I won.

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:42.860
So it seems.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.400
Suletta Mercury...

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.550
Huh? What the...

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:51.800
How did you...

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:54.300
This attire is the emblem of victory.

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:55.820
The emblem of the Holder.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:22:00.540
It's also the emblem of my fiance.

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:04.940
I told you, didn't I? Those are the rules.

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:07.070
But I...

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:09.300
I'm a woman.

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:12.430
I guess Mercury is rather conservative.

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:14.610
That sort of thing is commonplace here.

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:19.580
Nice to meet you, my groom.

00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:58.140
<i>Next time on</i>
Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury,

00:23:58.140 --> 00:23:59.710
<i>"The Cursed Mobile Suit."</i>
